OL,3,AMinister criticises media for
OL,4,A'amplifying' Russell Brand's prison
OL,5,Amessage
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe clip of Laura Brand has been played
OL,8,Fon outlets including BBC Radio 4's
OL,9,FToday programme, ITV's This Morning,
OL,10,FSky News, LBC and the News Agents
OL,11,Fpodcast. On Wednesday, Education
OL,12,FSecretary Powell said the media should
OL,13,Fnot have "amplified" his words.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
